# Hebt das "Require all denied" aus ntfy/.htaccess für diesen Ordner wieder auf
Require all granted
Options -Indexes
DirectoryIndex index.php

<FilesMatch "^\.">
    Require all denied
</FilesMatch>

<IfModule mod_rewrite.c>
    RewriteEngine On
    RewriteCond %{HTTPS} off
    RewriteRule ^ https://%{HTTP_HOST}%{REQUEST_URI} [R=301,L]
</IfModule>
